        <div class="body">
          <span class="num">02 / Performance</span>
          <h3>Google Ads</h3>
          <p>Search, Performance Max and YouTube campaigns built around the searches that bring buyers, not just clicks.</p>
          <ul class="caps"><li>Search &amp; Shopping</li><li>Performance Max</li><li>YouTube &amp; Demand Gen</li><li>Conversion tracking</li></ul>
          <a class="link" href="/contact">Learn more <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 03 TikTok -->
      <article class="svc">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
