          <h3>TikTok Ads</h3>
          <p>Short-form campaigns made for the feed, from the first-second hook to the checkout.</p>
          <ul class="caps"><li>Native creative</li><li>Spark Ads</li><li>Events API</li></ul>
          <a class="link" href="/contact">Learn more <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 04 Video & Creative Production -->
      <article class="svc">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 250">
            <defs><linearGradient id="vp" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#E8A25A"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8E1F2C"/></linearGradient></defs>
            <rect x="50" y="24" width="300" height="140" rx="6" fill="url(#vp)" opacity=".9"/>
            <g><rect x="50" y="178" width="300" height="48" rx="4" fill="#1E1418" stroke="#3A2A33"/>
              <rect class="a-slide" style="--i:0" x="58" y="186" width="70" height="14" rx="2" fill="#E8A25A"/>
