        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <span class="num">05 / Technology</span>
          <h3>Website Design &amp; Development</h3>
          <p>Fast, conversion-focused websites and landing pages, designed for mobile first.</p>
          <ul class="caps"><li>UX &amp; UI design</li><li>WordPress</li><li>Landing pages &amp; CRO</li></ul>
